<BES xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="BES.xsd">
  <Analysis>
    <Title>BigFix Server - Uploads Directory - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>This analysis provides information on the contents of the Uploads directory on the root BigFix server.</P>
<P>It can be used in conjunction with some session relevance to cleanup the Uploads directory on the BigFix Server itself. Information on doing that is available here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Platform-Kickstart/wiki/Cleanup-BigFix-Uploads-Directory">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Platform-Kickstart/wiki/Cleanup-BigFix-Uploads-Directory</A></P>
<P>For general information or to report issues with C3 Platform Kickstart content please visit GitHub here: <A href="https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Platform-Kickstart">https://github.com/strawgate/C3-Platform-Kickstart</A></P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>exists main gather service</Relevance>
    <Domain>BESC</Domain>
    <Property ID="1" Name="BES Server - Uploads with File Names - Windows">(name of it, concatenations &quot;, &quot; of names of files of it) of folders of folders &quot;Uploads&quot; of folders (values of settings &quot;_BESRelay_HTTPServer_ServerRootPath&quot; of client)</Property>
  </Analysis>
</BES>
